#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Specifies how a merge is handled when the merged-in "
"history is already a descendant of the current history.</p><p><br/></p><p><a"
" href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---"
"ff\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">More "
"information</span></a></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>مشخص می‌کند که ادغام در حالتی که تاریخچهٔ ادغام‌شده "
"هم‌اکنون از نوادگان تاریخچهٔ فعلی است، چگونه انجام شود.</p><p><br/></p><p><a"
" href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---"
"ff\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">اطلاعات "
"بیشتر</span></a></p></body></html>"

